=== The gift
--- The gift received, or rejected until reprobate [title]
overline: A post from the channel
heading: The gift received, or rejected until reprobate
sub: God would all choose the gift of righteousness through the sacrifice of Christ.
hint: Use the arrow keys or swipe to move through the slides. Tap any gold reference to read the verse.

--- Whosoever
scripture: John 3:16 | mark: the world
scripture: 2 Peter 3:9 | mark: any
scripture: Romans 10:13 | mark: whosoever

--- Since Seth
scripture: Genesis 4:26; Genesis 15:6; John 5:46

